OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue cases spread across
OL,4,AWest Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FCases of bluetongue virus, when can be
OL,7,Ffatal to some livestock, have spread to
OL,8,Fnew parts of the West Midlands,
OL,9,Faccording to the latest figures.
OL,11,FThe number of confirmed cases rose to
OL,12,F38 with Staffordshire showing the
OL,13,Fbiggest increase, as four new cases
OL,14,Ftook the total number of affected sites
OL,15,Fin the county to 24.
OL,17,FThere are also nine cases in
OL,18,FShropshire, two in Herefordshire and
OL,19,Fone each in Worcestershire,
OL,20,FWarwickshire and Solihull.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
