OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue cases spread across
OL,4,AWest Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe figures, from the Department for
OL,7,FEnvironment, Food and Rural Affairs
OL,8,F(Defra), cover cases between 10 July
OL,9,Fand 31 August.
